# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0097.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Chat UI -> API Client
API Client -> Chat Routes: HTTP / SSE
Chat Routes -> Gemini Service
Gemini Service -> Knowledge Base Service
Gemini Service -> Graph Knowledge Service
Knowledge Base Service -> Embedding Service
Embedding Service -> Google Gemini API: embed
Knowledge Base Service -> Pinecone: query / upsert
Knowledge Base Service -> MongoDB: CRUD
Knowledge Base Service -> Graph Knowledge Service: graph ingest
Graph Knowledge Service -> Google Gemini API: entity extraction
Graph Knowledge Service -> Neo4j AuraDB: read / write
Gemini Service -> Google Gemini API: chat
Chat Routes -> MongoDB: save messages
Knowledge CLI -> Knowledge Base Service
Knowledge CLI -> Graph Knowledge Service

Frontend (React + Vite) { Chat UI, API Client }
Backend (Express + TypeScript) { Chat Routes, Gemini Service, Knowledge Base Service, Graph Knowledge Service, Embedding Service, Knowledge CLI }
External Services { Google Gemini API, Pinecone, Neo4j AuraDB, MongoDB }
